While this clearly is something that is going wrong, you can use `transformItems` to hide an item from a list, instead of doing it with helper parameters:

```js
search.addWidget(
  instantsearch.widgets.refinementList({
    container: '#brand-list',
    attributeName: 'brand',
    transformItems: items => items.filter(item => item.label !== 'Sony'),
  })
);
```

